Same prompt, two GPT-6.2 models, 204 stones, 8 courses. Both finished the pyramid.

Astra's scene looked like a film set. Sol's was simpler, but it showed what every crew was doing. At $2/$10 per million tokens against Astra's $8/$40, Sol is our pick for everyday work, and Astra for heavy visual and 3D builds. It's one run each, so call it a first look.

